    description: "DEEP bakeoff cohort #20 (unleash): 214 routes registered via this.route({method, path, handler, permission}) are invisible. Only 47 routes detected (mostly from test files). The Controller base class wraps Express Router — this.route() eventually calls this.app[method](path, ...). Common pattern in structured Express apps. Need framework YAML pattern or Express analyzer enhancement to detect this.route({method: 'get', path: '/foo', handler: this.bar})."  # a042
